### Rehab Scheduler - Functional API checks
### Requires backend running at http://localhost:8080 and seed loaded.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@profA = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@profB = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@profInactive = 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555

### 1) Active professionals
GET {{baseUrl}}/professionals?active=true
Accept: application/json

### 2) Inactive professionals
GET {{baseUrl}}/professionals?active=false
Accept: application/json

### 3) Availability search for two professionals
POST {{baseUrl}}/availability/search
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "professionalIds": ["{{profA}}", "{{profB}}"],
  "startDate": "2026-10-19",
  "endDate": "2026-10-19",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "stepMinutes": 15
}

### 4) Create reservation (expected 201 HOLD)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "professionalIds": ["{{profA}}"],
  "startsAt": "2026-10-20T11:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-20T11:45:00",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-OK-001",
  "description": "Primera sesion de evaluacion"
}

> {%
client.global.set("reservationId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5) Confirm reservation (expected 200 CONFIRMED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reservations/{{reservationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### 6) Force conflict with existing HOLD in seed (expected 409 SCHEDULE_CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "professionalIds": ["{{profA}}"],
  "startsAt": "2026-10-19T09:15:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-19T09:45:00",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-CONFLICT-001",
  "description": "Solicitud que deberia entrar en conflicto"
}

### 7) Outside working hours (expected 422 OUTSIDE_WORKING_HOURS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "professionalIds": ["{{profA}}"],
  "startsAt": "2026-10-19T22:00:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-19T22:45:00",
  "referenceCode": "DEMO-OOH-001",
  "description": "Fuera de horario laboral"
}

### 8) Reservations by range
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?from=2026-10-19&to=2026-10-20
Accept: application/json

### 9) Reservations filtered by HOLD
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations?from=2026-10-19&to=2026-10-20&status=HOLD
Accept: application/json

